    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰνύω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύσω <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>complete, accomplish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ ποτέ σφιν νίκη ἐπηνύσθη, ἀλλ᾽
					ἄκριτον εἶχον ἄεθλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					311
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>procure,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἵαν . . ἐπί μοι μελέῳ χάριν
			ἠνύσω</span> codd. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				995
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>carry into effect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.77
			</span></i>.</div>
